# Retail data (wish of the project owner, 04.11.2026: "the treasure chests ... are a bit smaller with us than in Dolphin").
# The examine view of a picked-up item (game/examine.cpp exam_info: start angle, the divisor of the camera distance,
# light set) has three other rows in the retail main.dol files (EU, US and Japanese alike, compared row by row on
# 04.11.2026): the money chests 0x78 (x10 pesetas) and 0x79 (x100) with the
# divisors 1.1 and 1.4 instead of the prototype's 0.8 and 1.1 (shown about 1.3 to 1.4 times larger), and 0x6D.
# Taken over for the retail discs only (re4_disc_retail); the debug build's discs keep the prototype's table. A port
# patch for retail data.
